.com/india/india-will-face-serious-consequences-sc-on-crumbling-fear-of-overpopulation/articleshow/135538594.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135538594.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/india-will-face-serious-consequences-sc-on-crumbling-fear-of-overpopulation/articleshow/135538594.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/india-will-face-serious-consequences-sc-on-crumbling-fear-of-overpopulation/articleshow/135538594.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-04T17:34:38+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Karan Manral</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135538627,imgsize-81018.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Anubhav: TRAI launches platform to check internet speeds of different service providers]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/anubhav-trai-launches-platform-to-check-internet-speeds-of-different-service-providers/articleshow/135538513.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135538513.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[TRAI has introduced the Network Anubhav Platform to provide users with insights about internet speeds and network quality. This platform compiles user test data from MySpeed and MyCall applications, enhancing transparency for consumers. Telecom service providers can utilize this information for network optimization based on user feedback and metrics. The geospatial maps will categorize results by service provider and technology, aiding consumers in their analysis.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/anubhav-trai-launches-platform-to-check-internet-speeds-of-different-service-providers/articleshow/135538513.