k-at-rahul-gandhis-challenge-to-pm-modi/articleshow/135532146.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135532146.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[Assam Chief Minister Himanta Biswa Sarma criticized Congress leader Rahul Gandhi's proposal for a public debate with Prime Minister Modi. Sarma emphasized that such discussions should occur in Parliament, not publicly. He challenged Gandhi to raise various critical issues like Bofors and the Bhopal Gas Tragedy during parliamentary sessions. Rahul Gandhi had expressed a desire for a debate to address national connections and financial matters.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/debate-in-parliament-himanta-sarma-hits-back-at-rahul-gandhis-challenge-to-pm-modi/articleshow/135532146.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/debate-in-parliament-himanta-sarma-hits-back-at-rahul-gandhis-challenge-to-pm-modi/articleshow/135532146.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-04T14:29:17+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Yashasvi Vasistha</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135532914,imgsize-133268.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[PM Modi calls Sharad Pawar; advises complete rest]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/pm-modi-calls-sharad-pawar-advises-complete-rest/articleshow/135530871.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135530871.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/pm-modi-calls-sharad-pawar-advises-complete-rest/articleshow/135530871.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/pm-modi-calls-sharad-pawar-advises-complete-rest/articleshow/135530871.cms]]></guid><pubDate>