ical residents.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/rank-based-merit-list-to-replace-percentile-for-neet-pg-panel-to-sc/articleshow/135516685.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/rank-based-merit-list-to-replace-percentile-for-neet-pg-panel-to-sc/articleshow/135516685.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-04T05:37:04+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Amit Anand Choudhary</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135516735,imgsize-67588.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Indian tourist killed, PIO injured as copters collide during Everest rescue]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/indian-tourist-killed-pio-injured-as-copters-collide-during-everest-rescue/articleshow/135516590.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135516590.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/indian-tourist-killed-pio-injured-as-copters-collide-during-everest-rescue/articleshow/135516590.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/indian-tourist-killed-pio-injured-as-copters-collide-during-everest-rescue/articleshow/135516590.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-04T05:27:46+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Vishant V Agarwala</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135516637,imgsize-121800.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Take on Modi in Parliament, FM Sitharaman tells Rahul Gandhi on debate challenge]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/take-on-modi-in-parliament-fm-sitharaman-tells-rahul-gandhi-on-debate-challenge/articleshow/135516272.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-ri